    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452720/extras/18447bd2cb55871c908514a0195097f6.avif?t=1704819657\" /></span><br><br>Mystic Strife is a fast-paced chaotic party fighting game for up to eight friends. Choose one of six characters with unique abilities and prepare yourself for a simple yet surprisingly deep platforming deathmatch!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Ranger:</strong> Equipped with a bow and three recoverable arrows.<br></li><li> <strong>Wizard:</strong> Slings a torrent of fireballs and can cast a powerful long-range magic beam.<br></li><li> <strong>Necromancer:</strong> Raises the dead to muster a legion of skeletons that persist through rounds.<br></li><li> <strong>Rogue:</strong> Eqipped with a hookshot to quickly manuever around the stage and to pull in her foes.<br></li><li> <strong>Engineer:</strong> Equiped with a reloadable musket and can build repairable turrets.<br></li><li> <strong>Dragoon:</strong> Weilding a lance, she can take to the skies with a mighty leap and come crashing down with a powerful shockwave.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight platforming controls that are simple to learn, hard to master.<br></li><li> Deflect physical projectiles back at your opponents with a well-timed strike.<br></li><li> Pick up various powerups like shields, speed boosts and more.<br></li><li> Six unique characters.<br></li><li> Nine playable stages.</li></ul>\t<br><strong>PLEASE NOTE: This game has no single-player content. It must be played with your buddies IRL or through Steam Remote Play.</strong> (Buddies not included)",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2452720/extras/18447bd2cb55871c908514a0195097f6.avif?t=1704819657\" /></span><br><br>Mystic Strife is a fast-paced chaotic party fighting game for up to eight friends. Choose one of six characters with unique abilities and prepare yourself for a simple yet surprisingly deep platforming deathmatch!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Ranger:</strong> Equipped with a bow and three recoverable arrows.<br></li><li> <strong>Wizard:</strong> Slings a torrent of fireballs and can cast a powerful long-range magic beam.<br></li><li> <strong>Necromancer:</strong> Raises the dead to muster a legion of skeletons that persist through rounds.<br></li><li> <strong>Rogue:</strong> Eqipped with a hookshot to quickly manuever around the stage and to pull in her foes.<br></li><li> <strong>Engineer:</strong> Equiped with a reloadable musket and can build repairable turrets.<br></li><li> <strong>Dragoon:</strong> Weilding a lance, she can take to the skies with a mighty leap and come crashing down with a powerful shockwave.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tight platforming controls that are simple to learn, hard to master.<br></li><li> Deflect physical projectiles back at your opponents with a well-timed strike.<br></li><li> Pick up various powerups like shields, speed boosts and more.<br></li><li> Six unique characters.<br></li><li> Nine playable stages.</li></ul>\t<br><strong>PLEASE NOTE: This game has no single-player content. It must be played with your buddies IRL or through Steam Remote Play.</strong> (Buddies not included)",
